# key.properties and app/release-keystore.jks are intentionally versioned here
# (not ignored). This app is distributed as a direct APK download, not through
# the Play Store, and its SHA-1 fingerprint is registered as the Android OAuth
# client in Google Cloud Console. Building on a different machine without this
# exact keystore falls back to that machine's own debug key, which has a
# different SHA-1 and breaks Google Sign-In with DEVELOPER_ERROR (ApiException 10).
# This has already happened twice -- do not re-add these to gitignore.
